{"seq":2,"slug":"sampling-strategies-random-grid-quasi-monte-carlo","title":"采样策略机制：随机、网格、拉丁超立方与 Sobol 准蒙特卡洛对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/hpo-search-strategy-theory/sampling-strategies-random-grid-quasi-monte-carlo","wordCount":2607,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"采样策略机制-随机-网格-拉丁超立方与-sobol-准蒙特卡洛对比\">采样策略机制：随机、网格、拉丁超立方与 Sobol 准蒙特卡洛对比</h1><p>采样器（sampler）是超参优化里最容易被当成&quot;随机数发生器&quot;而低估的组件。它决定的是给定预算下你究竟&quot;看过了搜索空间的哪些地方&quot;——同一个代理模型、同一份预算，换一种候选点生成方式，命中好区域的速度可以差出一个数量级。本文只谈采样层：随机搜索、网格搜索、拉丁超立方与 Sobol 准蒙特卡洛各自的覆盖机制、可扩展维度与失败边界。空间本身的尺度与条件依赖建模属于前置问题，见同 hub 的<a href=\"hyperparameter-space-and-search-budget-modeling\">超参空间建模与搜索预算</a>；而采样之后如何用代理模型做序贯决策，见<a href=\"../bayesian-optimization-surrogate/gaussian-process-surrogate-and-acquisition-functions\">高斯过程代理与采集函数</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-采样器把连续空间压缩成有限候选集\">核心概念：采样器把连续空间压缩成有限候选集</h2><p>一个采样器的输入是搜索空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 与试验预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，输出是候选点集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>N</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⊂</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{x_1, \\dots, x_N\\} \\subset \\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊂</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>。这个过程在信息论上是有损的：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1464em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 通常不可数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 却只有几十到几千。采样策略的差异，本质上是面对同一份损失预算时选择保住哪种结构——网格保住每维的均匀网格，随机保住统计无偏，拉丁超立方保住每维的一维分层，Sobol 额外保住低维投影的空间填充性（低差异）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[搜索空间 + 试验预算 N] --&gt; B{空间是有限离散组合?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[网格 / BruteForce&lt;br/&gt;穷举全部组合]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要一维分层保证?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[拉丁超立方&lt;br/&gt;每维等概率区间各取一点]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{需要低维投影均匀?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[Sobol / Halton&lt;br/&gt;低差异序列]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[随机搜索&lt;br/&gt;无偏兜底基线]&#10;    C --&gt; I[返回候选点集]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n    A[搜索空间 + 试验预算 N] --&gt; B{空间是有限离散组合?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[网格 / BruteForce&lt;br/&gt;穷举全部组合]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要一维分层保证?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[拉丁超立方&lt;br/&gt;每维等概率区间各取一点]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{需要低维投影均匀?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[Sobol / Halton&lt;br/&gt;低差异序列]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[随机搜索&lt;br/&gt;无偏兜底基线]\n    C --&gt; I[返回候选点集]\n    E --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p>四种策略在覆盖保证与可扩展性上各有权衡，下表是选型的第一张速查表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>覆盖保证</th>\n<th>维度可扩展性</th>\n<th>支持条件空间</th>\n<th>典型预算（试验数）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网格搜索</td>\n<td>每维每格点必被覆盖</td>\n<td>极差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>全组合数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机搜索</td>\n<td>期望无偏，无硬保证</td>\n<td>好（试验互不重复）</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉丁超立方</td>\n<td>每维一维分层严格保证</td>\n<td>中（高维分层失效）</td>\n<td>有限支持</td>\n<td>预先固定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sobol 准蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>低维投影低差异</td>\n<td>好（至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>21201</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le 21201</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21201</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>建议取 2 的幂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"随机搜索与网格搜索-维度一高网格必然认输\">随机搜索与网格搜索：维度一高网格必然认输</h2><p>网格搜索的直觉是&quot;系统全面&quot;，但它的代价随维度指数增长：若每维取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个格点、名义维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，则总试验数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。要在某个真正重要的维度上覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个不同取值，网格需要付出指数级代价。Bergstra 与 Bengio 在 2012 年 JMLR 的 <em>Random Search for Hyper-Parameter Optimization</em> 中给出了决定性论证：他们用高斯过程分析发现&quot;对多数数据集而言只有少数几个超参真正起作用&quot;，且起作用的那几个随数据集而变。在<strong>低有效维度</strong>空间里，网格把大量试验浪费在无关维度上——把这些试验投影到真正重要的子空间，网格点会大量重叠成完全相同的点；随机采样的试验则几乎每一点都在重要子空间里提供新信息。</p>\n<p>该论文的实证结果同样直接：在深度信念网络（32 个超参）上，随机搜索与人工+网格调参在 7 个数据集中的 4 个上统计持平、在 1 个上更优；在神经网络实验里，随机搜索用&quot;计算时间的一小部分&quot;就达到或超过网格搜索的模型质量。这奠定了此后十余年的工程默认：<strong>随机搜索是任何新问题的第一基线</strong>，也是序贯方法（TPE、高斯过程）的对照物。</p>\n<p>随机搜索并非没有弱点。它没有覆盖保证，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个点在高维空间里近似稀疏；小预算（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N &lt; 3d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>）时，纯随机会留下大片未被探查的区域。这正是分层与低差异序列要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"拉丁超立方-一维分层的严格保证\">拉丁超立方：一维分层的严格保证</h2><p>拉丁超立方采样（Latin Hypercube Sampling, LHS）由 McKay、Beckman 与 Conover 于 1979 年在洛斯阿拉莫斯国家实验室提出（<em>Technometrics</em>）。机制很干净：对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个变量中的每一个，把取值范围切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个等概率区间，然后放置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，使每个变量在这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个区间中各被命中恰好一次——这相当于棋盘上互不攻击的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个车的高维推广。由于每个区间被采样一次，LHS 保证样本&quot;代表变量的真实变异范围&quot;，而普通随机采样&quot;只是一组没有任何保证的随机数&quot;。</p>\n<p>这一分层性质带来两个直接好处。其一是<strong>边际覆盖</strong>：任何单变量维度上，样本的分布直方图都是均匀的，不会出现某个区间被完全漏掉。其二是<strong>加变量不加样本</strong>：LHS 的点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 需事先固定，但增加变量数不必增加样本数。代价也来自这一点——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 必须预先确定，无法边跑边加；而且分层保证是逐维度的，在高维空间里&quot;一维分层&quot;并不能阻止二维或更高维投影上的聚集。</p>\n<p>SciPy 的 <code>scipy.stats.qmc.LatinHypercube</code> 提供了工程实现，其 <code>strength</code> 参数可把经典 LHS（<code>strength=1</code>，仅一维分层）提升为正交数组式的更强平衡。实践中 LHS 常用于构建计算机实验设计与蒙特卡洛积分，在中等维度（数维到数十维）的贝叶斯优化初始化阶段尤其常见——它比纯随机更均匀地把初始点铺满空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sobol-与准蒙特卡洛-低差异序列的填充性\">Sobol 与准蒙特卡洛：低差异序列的填充性</h2><p>Sobol 序列由 Ilya M. Sobol 于 1967 年提出，属于准蒙特卡洛（Quasi-Monte Carlo, QMC）中的低差异序列，在二进制下逐维细分单位区间并重排坐标。它与随机采样、LHS 的根本差别在于<strong>分布均匀性的度量</strong>：QMC 用差异（discrepancy）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量点集的空间填充质量，而不是依赖概率。由 Koksma–Hlawka 不等式，积分误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ε</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>N</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\varepsilon| \\le V(f)\\, D_N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(f)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是函数的 Hardy–Krause 变差。由此得到最坏情况收敛阶</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msup></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O\\!\\left(\\frac{(\\log N)^s}{N}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而普通蒙特卡洛的误差是概率性的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^{-1/2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。在平滑被积函数与中等维度下，QMC 通常显著更快；只有在维度极高、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\log N)^s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 项失控时才需要额外的序列选择或变量变换。Morokoff 与 Caflisch 的对比给出了一条经验规则：Halton 序列在大约六维以下表现最强，Sobol 在高维更优，Faure 弱于两者但仍强于伪随机。</p>\n<p>Sobol 的工程细节里有一个最容易踩的坑：<strong>平衡性（balance）要求样本数取 2 的幂</strong>。Sobol 序列本质是一套积分求积规则，只有在点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 2^m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时其平衡性质才成立；非 2 的幂、跳过首点或抽稀都会破坏这一性质。SciPy 因此提供了专门的 <code>random_base2(m)</code>，文档明确说明它&quot;保证序列的平衡性质&quot;，而通用的 <code>random</code> 方法允许任意点数但附带该警告。另一个细节是随机化：SciPy 的 <code>scipy.stats.qmc.Sobol</code> 默认启用 LMS+shift 扰乱（一种线性矩阵扰乱后接数字随机移位），既能改善收敛又允许用多次独立复制估计误差；<code>scramble=False</code> 则得到未扰乱的确定性序列。SciPy 使用的 Joe–Kuo 方向数支持到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>21201</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\le 21201</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">21201</span></span></span></span></span> 维。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>随机搜索</th>\n<th>拉丁超立方</th>\n<th>Sobol QMC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单维分层</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>严格保证</td>\n<td>近似保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低维投影填充</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强（低差异）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本数约束</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需事先固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>建议取 2 的幂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可加样本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（<code>random_base2</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误差估计</td>\n<td>天然</td>\n<td>复制法</td>\n<td>扰乱后复制法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-在-optuna-里选对-qmc_type-与预算\">工程落地：在 Optuna 里选对 qmc_type 与预算</h2><p>把上述理论落到主流框架时，几处默认值必须知道。Optuna 的 <code>optuna.samplers.QMCSampler</code> 是内置的准蒙特卡洛采样器，其 <code>qmc_type</code> <strong>只接受 <code>&quot;halton&quot;</code> 与 <code>&quot;sobol&quot;</code> 两个值</strong>，默认 <code>&quot;sobol&quot;</code>；<code>scramble</code> 默认 <code>False</code>（代码注释说明这是为了简化分布式使用），只有开启扰乱时 <code>seed</code> 才起作用。更要紧的一条限制是：<code>QMCSampler</code> 在第一个试验后推断并固定搜索空间，之后<strong>不可更改</strong>，且明确假设搜索空间不含任何条件依赖——一旦出现动态或条件空间，它会回退到独立采样。因此条件超参空间不要用 QMC。</p>\n<p>Optuna 官方采样器文档给出的预算建议可以直接照抄：<code>RandomSampler</code> 与 <code>QMCSampler</code> 试验数不限，<code>TPESampler</code> 约 100–1000 次，<code>GPSampler</code> 约 500 次以内，<code>CmaEsSampler</code> 约 1000–10000 次。这解释了一条被反复验证的工程流程：<strong>先用 QMC 或随机采样做广覆盖的暖启动（若干倍于有效维度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的试验），再把历史交给 TPE 或高斯过程做序贯细化</strong>——采样器负责&quot;铺得均匀&quot;，代理模型负责&quot;往好区域收窄&quot;。还要注意可复现性：采样器的 <code>seed</code> 在 <code>Study.optimize(n_jobs != 1)</code> 时会被重新播种，并行执行下结果难以逐位复现，分布式场景官方建议用 <code>seed=None</code> 或各进程使用不同种子。</p>\n<p>选型时可以按三条判据收敛：空间是有限离散组合且组合数可控，用网格或 <code>BruteForceSampler</code>；空间含条件依赖，用随机采样或 TPE；空间为纯连续/独立类别且希望用最少试验铺满，用 Sobol QMC（点数取 2 的幂）或拉丁超立方。三者并不互斥——一条常见且稳健的流水线是 Sobol 暖启动接 TPE 序贯优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采样器的职责是在有限预算下决定候选点的空间分布，差异集中在&quot;保住哪种覆盖结构&quot;上。</li>\n<li>网格搜索的试验数随维度以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸；在低有效维度问题上，随机搜索在同等预算下更高效（Bergstra &amp; Bengio, JMLR 2012）。</li>\n<li>拉丁超立方保证每维一维分层，样本数须事先固定，是贝叶斯优化初始化的常用选择（McKay et al., 1979）。</li>\n<li>Sobol 属于低差异 QMC，最坏情况收敛阶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>s</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((\\log N)^s / N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，优于蒙特卡洛的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^{-1/2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；样本数建议取 2 的幂（<code>random_base2</code>），SciPy 支持到 21201 维。</li>\n<li>工程上先 QMC/随机暖启动、再 TPE/GP 序贯细化；条件空间避开 <code>QMCSampler</code>，并行时注意 <code>seed</code> 会被重新播种。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[采样策略选型] --&gt; B[网格/BruteForce&lt;br/&gt;有限离散组合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[随机搜索&lt;br/&gt;无条件空间兜底基线]&#10;    A --&gt; D[拉丁超立方&lt;br/&gt;固定预算的均匀初始化]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Sobol QMC&lt;br/&gt;低差异 + 2 的幂]&#10;    D --&gt; F[暖启动]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    C --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[TPE / GP 序贯细化]\">graph TD\n    A[采样策略选型] --&gt; B[网格/BruteForce&lt;br/&gt;有限离散组合]\n    A --&gt; C[随机搜索&lt;br/&gt;无条件空间兜底基线]\n    A --&gt; D[拉丁超立方&lt;br/&gt;固定预算的均匀初始化]\n    A --&gt; E[Sobol QMC&lt;br/&gt;低差异 + 2 的幂]\n    D --&gt; F[暖启动]\n    E --&gt; F\n    C --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[TPE / GP 序贯细化]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采样策略机制：随机、网格、拉丁超立方与 Sobol 准蒙特卡洛对比","id":"采样策略机制-随机-网格-拉丁超立方与-sobol-准蒙特卡洛对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：采样器把连续空间压缩成有限候选集","id":"核心概念-采样器把连续空间压缩成有限候选集"},{"level":2,"text":"随机搜索与网格搜索：维度一高网格必然认输","id":"随机搜索与网格搜索-维度一高网格必然认输"},{"level":2,"text":"拉丁超立方：一维分层的严格保证","id":"拉丁超立方-一维分层的严格保证"},{"level":2,"text":"Sobol 与准蒙特卡洛：低差异序列的填充性","id":"sobol-与准蒙特卡洛-低差异序列的填充性"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：在 Optuna 里选对 qmc_type 与预算","id":"工程落地-在-optuna-里选对-qmc_type-与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超参空间建模与搜索预算：维度诅咒、条件超参与收敛预算估算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/hpo-search-strategy-theory/hyperparameter-space-and-search-budget-modeling"},"next":{"title":"搜索策略失效诊断与实操：预算分配、并行度与病态空间处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/automl-hyperparameter-optimization-engineering/hpo-search-strategy-theory/search-strategy-diagnostics-and-practical-workflow"}}